; possession verb: "ball HAS mass 5 kg"
; signals entity→property ownership in question graphs
; has IS shashthi-vibhakti expressed as an English verb
; has = present tense, singular (third person)

(bhasha verb-has
  (swarupa kriya)
  (sthita sambandha shashthi-vibhakti eka-vachana vartamana-kaala prathama-purusa))
